      "heading": "Overview",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "Use an `appReviewAttachments` resource to upload specific app documentation, demo videos, and other items to App Store Connect, to help prevent delays during the app review process.",
          "refs": []
        },
        {
          "text": "For more information, see `https://developer.apple.com/help/app-store-connect/reference/app-review-information`.",
